{TOOL_NAME_CAP} ({TOOL_NAME}) - version TOOL_VERSION
============================================================

Quick Install
-------------

    curl -LsSf https://astral.sh/uv/install.sh | sh   # if uv is not installed yet
    uv sync
    ./configure

uv sync creates ./.venv with Python 3.11 and the locked dependencies. See
"Usage" to run the tool and "Installation" for a shared install.

